      "summaries": {
        "en": "Universal Android Debloater Next Generation is a cross-platform GUI tool that removes unwanted pre-installed apps (bloatware) from non-rooted Android devices via ADB, enhancing privacy, security, and battery life. Its key technical strength lies in using Rust for performance and safety, combined with community-maintained debloat lists for safe removal. You can use it to selectively disable or uninstall system apps, reclaim storage, and reduce background activity—ideal for cleaning up manufacturer or carrier bloatware on any Android phone.",
        "zh": "Universal Android Debloater Next Generation 是一款跨平台图形界面工具，通过 ADB 连接无需 root 即可移除安卓设备上的预装臃肿软件，从而提升隐私、安全性和续航。其技术亮点在于采用 Rust 语言开发，兼顾高性能与内存安全，并依托社区维护的“去臃肿清单”确保操作安全。使用时，你只需连接设备，勾选想移除的应用即可一键禁用或卸载，有效释放存储空间、减少后台活动。非常适合清理厂商或运营商预装的无用应用，让旧手机重获新生。",
        "es": "Universal Android Debloater Next Generation is a cross-platform GUI tool that removes unwanted pre-installed apps (bloatware) from non-rooted Android devices via ADB, enhancing privacy, security, and battery life. Its key technical strength lies in using Rust for performance and safety, combined with community-maintained debloat lists for safe removal. You can use it to selectively disable or uninstall system apps, reclaim storage, and reduce background activity—ideal for cleaning up manufacturer or carrier bloatware on any Android phone.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "universal-android-debloater-next-generation stands out for adb, android, and bloatware-list in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Universal Android Debloater Next Generation is a cross-platform GUI tool that removes unwanted pre-installed apps (bloatware) from non-rooted Android devices via ADB, enhancing privacy, security, and battery life. Its key technical strength lies in using Rust for performance and safety, combined with community-maintained debloat lists for safe removal. You can use it to selectively disable or uninstall system apps, reclaim storage, and reduce background activity—ideal for cleaning up manufacturer or carrier bloatware on any Android phone.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Universal-Debloater-Alliance/universal-android-debloater-next-generation for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
